        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Take the incoming availability data. Pass along everything before \"Screenshots:\" in a field called \"Availability\".\n\nHere is the current date: {{ $now }}\n\nTake the incoming availability data and return the screenshot URLs for the month or month's requested by the user in a field called \"Screenshot\". Here is the dates requested by the user: {{ $('Execute Workflow Trigger').item.json.query }}\n\nIn the incoming data, \"This month\" will be the current month. \"Next month\" will be the following month and so on.\n\n*Example*\n- If the user asks for January and it is currently November, you will return the URL for \"Month 3\"\n- If the user asks for December and it is currently November, you will return the URL for \"Next month\"\n\n\n*NOTES*\nIf the user requests dates across multiple months, please return URLs for BOTH months. You should do each URL in a separate field. \nExample: If the user asks for January and December, return January's URL in a field called \"Screenshot\" and return December's URL in a field called \"Screenshot 2\"",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Here is the incoming availability data: {{ $json.data }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
